<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hm... Good to see you.\fNo need to explain why you came.\rClair sent you, didn’t she?\fThat girl a HANDFUL. Since she was\ntwo.\rSorry, but I gotta test you.\rDon’t trip, it’s just a few\nquestions. Like a job interview. With\fdragons.\fReady?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What are homies to you? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What help you win scraps? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What kinda Hustler you wanna\nscrap with? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What matter most when you\nraisin’ homies? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Strong homies. Weak homies.\nWhich one matter more? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hm... I see...\nYou deadass care about homies.\rThat’s respectable.\fThat conviction is what matter!\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, don’t lose that.\rIt’ll carry you through the\nBig League.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hah? I ain’t catch that...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What you say?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, I understand...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So how it go?\rI guess no point askin’. You failed,\nright? Everybody fail.\f...\f...What? You PASSED?!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{SIZE 200}That can’t be!{SIZE 100}\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You LYIN’!\nEven I ain’t been approved! I been\ftryin’ for TWELVE YEARS!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clair!\rThis child is FLAWLESS, in skill and\nspirit!\rTake the L and hand over the Rising\nChain!\r...Or do I gotta call Lance?\nYou know I’ll call Lance.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I... I understand...\nDon’t call Lance. Please.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Here, this the Rising Chain... Hurry\nup! Take it! Before I CRY!\fI’m not cryin’. It’s the dragons.\nAllergies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe Rising Chain from Clair!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Rising Chain let your\nhomies use the move for\fclimbin’ waterfalls.\rAlso, every homie gon’ see you as\na Hustler and do whatever\fyou say, no questions.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clair...\rThink about what you missin’ that\nthis child got. Humility. Manners.\fA normal outfit.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\n...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By the way... You heard of LUGIA?\rA homie they say lived round the\nWhirl Islands...\f...Never mind.\rJust old man talk. I ramble.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By the way...\nYou heard of LUGIA?\fEr...\rBetween Olivine and Cianwood is\nislands called the Whirl Islands.\rThere’s a huge waterfall deep in\nthe cave there. They say LUGIA\rrest at the bottom of the\nwaterfall basin...\rYou need a Silver Wing to reach\nthe waterfall basin, I heard...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s a huge waterfall deep in\nthe cave there. They say LUGIA\rrest at the bottom of the\nwaterfall basin...\rYou need a Silver Wing to reach\nthe waterfall basin, I heard...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come back anytime. Bring snacks.\nThe dragons like Takis.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s been a LONG time since a Hustler\ngot our Master’s approval.\rNot since Master Lance. And he had\nthe cape. Cape do a lot.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know young Master Lance?\rHe look JUST like our Master did when\nhe was young.\fIt’s in the blood. And the cape.\fThe cape is genetic.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hm... Good to see you.\rPerfect timin’.\nI got somethin’ for you.\rTake this DRATINI as proof I\nknow what you worth.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nDRATINI from the Master!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hm? Your crew full.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Dragon homies is the symbol of our\nclan.\rYou showed we can trust you with\none. Don’t let it eat the furniture.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clair learned a lesson from you she\nDEADASS needed.\rGood looks, from her grandpa.\nShe been a brat since birth.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A boy your age trainin’ here. Red\nhair. Mad at everythin’.\rHe a lot like Clair when she was\nyounger. Kinda worries me...\fShe threw a dragon at a mailman\nonce.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0130_D44R0103_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Give the DRATINI you got\na street name? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
</body>
